        "description_zh": "邓颖超与周恩来同为毛泽东时代的重要领导人，在妇女解放、党内民主和外交领域作出了独特贡献。她与周恩来相辅相成，共同体现了老一辈革命家的政治品格和精神风范",
        "description_en": "Deng Yingchao and Zhou Enlai were both important leaders in the Mao era, making unique contributions to women's liberation, party democracy and diplomacy. Together they embodied the political character of the revolutionary generation"
